    "When you say \"maximize total revenue,\" do you mean maximize total sales revenue (sell price × units sold) only, or maximize net profit (sales revenue minus purchase cost)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two definitions of the objective function."
}

